#### describe

List resources

#### parameter

```
parameter: {
	type:      "ns" | "secret" | "configMap" | "pvc" | "storageClass"
	namespace: *"" | string // Optional
	cluster:   *"" | string // Optional
}
```

#### statusKey

`status`

#### query result

```
